  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Make Me A Pallet On The Floor**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Today**: back after 64 archived shows (468 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Airmail Special**: back after 75 archived shows (545 days) [2]\n- **Lonesome Moonlight Waltz**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Walking Boss**: back after 302 archived shows (2042 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: I'm One Of Those [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-06-13.akg483** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 157 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-06-13.akg483**: taped by Rob O'Brien; transferred by Rob O'Brien; source: AKG C480 B / CK63-ULS (DIN) > Tascam FR-AV2 (32/96) [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG C480 B microphones with CK63-ULS capsules, running through a DIN connection into a Tascam FR-AV2 at 32-bit/96k; Transfer chain: SD card to PC, edited in Wave Lab 6.1 and downsampled to 24/96, tracked in CD Wave, then encoded to FLAC 8 with Traders Little Helper [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-run-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - N2 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-n2-regular-poster/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-run-poster-regular/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-run-poster-regular/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-run-poster-regular/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Chaifetz Arena 2025 - N2 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/chaifetz-arena-2025-n2-regular-poster/) [8]",
